      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The game is the orchestrator's durable unit: the orchestrator operates on a stable game boundary rather than embedding Melee-specific behavior into its core model. Melee is the configured game today, while cycles and save points provide the durable work and evidence contracts that apply to every game."
